   "landed 2026-07-09: kotoba-lang/standard-model#9 merged as
    3710b427ed90b0a7afce3a08b00212bda8b7bcd8, 68 tests/2740 assertions
    (up from 58/2465 at ADR-2607101900's close), CI green JDK 17+21;
